// Kitchen sink: every DSL v0 construct in one plan.
# project: kitchen-sink
# fixture
VAR iteration = 0
VAR budget = 100
VAR title = "mvp"

-> build_mvp

=== build_mvp ===
Ship the smallest testable slice.
Iterate until metrics are green or we run out of strikes.
# github:issue: 1
~ iteration += 1
~ budget -= 10
* [Metrics green] @human -> beta_launch
+ {iteration < 3} [Learnings, go again] ~loop~ -> build_mvp
* {iteration >= 3} [Three strikes] -> pivot_or_kill

=== beta_launch ===
Launch "mvp" to the beta cohort.
* {title == "mvp"} [Announce] -> retro
* [Quiet launch] -> retro

=== pivot_or_kill ===
Decide whether to pivot or stop.
+ [Pivot] @human ~loop~ -> build_mvp
* [Kill it] @human -> retro

=== retro ===
Write the retro; archive the plan.
-> END
